        "justification": "Coordinate permutations fixing 1 transport the canonical inverse families to all three pairs. Intersections equal the supplied B lists 210,28,1,0,0 for c=4,6,8,10,12. The construction pulls the auxiliary pairing through the actual arbitrary crossing bijection; reduction is uniform in A and C."
