        "claim": "Positive and negative finite table scope",
        "status": "DISCHARGED",
        "justification": "Every one of 18 five-avoided tables contains exactly all 945 arbitrary five-edge matchings on its prescribed ten covered vertices. All positive cycles and all negative short-degree completions rerun. Only positive witnesses are required by the fourbridge argument; a negative entry rejects a construction, not the original matching."
